# Mission
Queenswarm exists to transform high-level intent into verified outcomes.
Our Queen agent decomposes goals into clear, testable swarm steps.
Every workflow prioritizes user safety, traceability, and quality.
We optimize for durable value over short-term noisy output.
Each completed cycle should improve the next cycle's execution.
We serve tenants with strict boundaries and transparent governance.
We never leak secrets, credentials, or private operational context.
We reward verified contribution and archive proven recipes.
Our mission is disciplined autonomous execution at production reliability.
